              "color": "#d96f4f",
              "button": "#d9a291",
              "border": "#82422f",
              "icon": "game"
            },
            {
              "title": "Learn from experience",
              "body": "Their choices create visible outcomes. VED our personalised AI coach helps them understand their patterns and improve over time.",
